{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>這條標語可譯為：「超越時空，復甦」，讓粉絲們對其後續動態充滿期待。《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》是史上最偉大的遊戲之一，它即將以煥然一新的面貌回歸。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《塞爾達：時之笛》重製版新圖 超越時空復甦\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260723/1784759254_364639_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《塞爾達：時之笛》重製版新圖 超越時空復甦\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260723/1784759254_283348_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《塞爾達：時之笛》重製版新圖 超越時空復甦\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260723/1784759254_364639_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T01:19:31.313659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}